      "display": "Another World 20th Anniversary Edition game folder",
      "description": "A zip of the game folder of the 20th Anniversary Edition (DAT, BMP or BGZ, WGZ, OGG, TXT). GOG's copy is inside its installer, which innoextract can open. Zips made by different people differ, so no particular file is required. You have to supply it, because this package includes none of the game's files. A file of your own can be used in its place, and the project then records its hash.",
