    {
      "id": "dos-demo",
      "display": "Out of This World DOS demo",
      "description": "Interplay's DOS demo from 1992, as the file it is distributed in (ootwdemo.zip, holding MEMLIST.BIN and five BANK files), or a zip of its files. You have to supply it, because this package includes none of the game's files. A file of your own can be used in its place, and the project then records its hash.",
