      "description": "CM32L_PCM.ROM is not one of the game's files. It is the PCM ROM of the Roland CM-32L (1 MB), used for the MT-32 Sound Effects setting. You have to supply it, because this package includes none of it. Another PCM ROM that Munt knows can be used in its place, and the project then records its hash.",
