    {
      "id": "soundfont.sf2",
      "display": "General MIDI SoundFont",
      "description": "soundfont.sf2 is not one of the game's files. It is a General MIDI SoundFont (.sf2) of your choice, for example FluidR3 GM, GeneralUser GS or one sampled from a Roland Sound Canvas. It is used for the Windows 3.1 release's music (the SoundFont Music setting). No particular file is required. The project records the hash of the one you chose. Another SoundFont gives another sound, and the game stays the same.",
